{"5135810":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Desktop Trip","steam_appid":5135810,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open a little window to the world outside, even when you're too busy to step away from your computer.<br>Your little car speeds up as you type, or you can simply let it cruise along while you enjoy the passing scenery.<br>As time and distance add up, collect your favorite cars, from rare finds to wonderfully weird rides. Until you have time for a trip of your own, let your little car explore for you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's hit the road! Everything you need is along the way :)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have any suggestions or encounter any issues, feel free to share them in the community or join our QQ group: 881830127.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open a little window to the world outside, even when you're too busy to step away from your computer.<br>Your little car speeds up as you type, or you can simply let it cruise along while you enjoy the passing scenery.<br>As time and distance add up, collect your favorite cars, from rare finds to wonderfully weird rides. Until you have time for a trip of your own, let your little car explore for you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's hit the road! Everything you need is along the way :)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have any suggestions or encounter any issues, feel free to share them in the community or join our QQ group: 881830127.<\/p>","short_description":"A desktop companion game. Open a tiny window on the screen to a distant place.","supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135810\/64310ea9920aa33e9e3fa09fcadd661732b43bb3\/header.jpg?t=1793695210","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/st